UniField: A Unified Field-Aware MRI Enhancement Framework

This repository contains selected code adapted from the author's local FlashVSR
MRI implementation and the Apache-2.0 FlashVSR / DiffSynth Studio codebase.

FlashVSR: Junhao Zhuang, Shi Guo, Xin Cai, Xiaohui Li, Yihao Liu,
Chun Yuan, Tianfan Xue. https://github.com/OpenImagingLab/FlashVSR
DiffSynth Studio: https://github.com/modelscope/DiffSynth-Studio
The Tiny Conditional Decoder derives from taehv:
https://github.com/madebyollin/taehv
Copyright (c) 2025 Ollin Boer Bohan. MIT license retained in
third_party/taehv-MIT.txt. Its decoder has been pruned, widened and adapted
for bidirectional MRI slice decoding in unifield/backbones/tcdecoder.py.

Retained backbone files live in unifield/backbones. UniField additions include
FASFL, explicit MRI manifests, sparse SDPA reference execution, differentiable
cross-attention, DDP training, checkpointing and NIfTI evaluation.

Third-party pretrained weights are supplied separately and retain their upstream
terms, source links, and licenses. Our trained UniField LoRA weights, optimizer
states, and training checkpoints are private and are not released.
